# Agent scratch. .claude/worktrees/ holds linked worktrees created inside the
# repo; .superpowers/ holds subagent-driven-development ledgers, task briefs and
# review packages. Both are working state, never history. Only the worktrees
# subdirectory is ignored, so a project-level .claude/settings.json or a shared
# agent definition can still be committed.
